# Complete E-Commerce Shopping App – All Features from Start to End

Below is a comprehensive feature blueprint for building a professional shopping application like Myntra, Meesho, Amazon and Flipkart.

This covers the entire platform, starting from customer registration and product discovery through ordering, delivery, returns, seller management, payments, marketing, and super admin operations.

The platform will have three main systems:

1. Customer App – For people who purchase products.
2. Seller Panel – For vendors who list and sell products.
3. Super Admin Panel – For controlling the complete marketplace.

