# PART 7. Complete Customer Shopping Journey

This is the actual workflow that connects all the features.

## Customer order journey

1. Open application

   Splash screen → Language → Location
2. Create account

   Mobile number → OTP → Login
3. Discover products

   Home → Categories → Search → Filters
4. Select products

   Product details → Images → Variants → Reviews
5. Add to shopping bag

   Wishlist → Cart → Coupons → Discounts
6. Place order

   Address → Delivery option → Payment → Confirmation
7. Seller processing

   Seller accepts → Packs → Prints label → Dispatches
8. Delivery

   Courier pickup → Tracking → Out for delivery → Delivered
9. After delivery

   Rating → Review → Reorder → Rewards
10. If there is a problem

    Return → Pickup → Inspection → Refund or replacement

